0:{"buildId":"7TV3WSDnKGdgKVGmLMU3E","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Destinations"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"Why Indian Students Should Look Beyond Canada, UK and Australia in 2026 — Is Luxembourg the Smarter Study Abroad Bet?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"For most Indian families, the study abroad conversation begins in the same way. “Canada is good, right?” “What about UK?”"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","“US is expensive, but worth it if the university is top-ranked.”",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"“US is expensive, but worth it if the university is top-ranked.”"}],[["$","p","And honestly, these questions are understandable. For years, Indian students have seen these countries as the default map of ambition. Canada meant affordability and immigration pathways.",{"children":"And honestly, these questions are understandable. For years, Indian students have seen these countries as the default map of ambition. Canada meant affordability and immigration pathways."}],["$","p","The UK meant prestige and a shorter master’s degree. Australia meant lifestyle and post-study options. The US meant scale, STEM, and global recognition.",{"children":"The UK meant prestige and a shorter master’s degree. Australia meant lifestyle and post-study options. The US meant scale, STEM, and global recognition."}],["$","p","But 2026 is not 2016.",{"children":"But 2026 is not 2016."}],["$","p","The study abroad world has changed. Visa rules are tighter. Costs are higher. Post-study work routes are being reviewed, reduced, or made more selective. Families are more cautious.",{"children":"The study abroad world has changed. Visa rules are tighter. Costs are higher. Post-study work routes are being reviewed, reduced, or made more selective. Families are more cautious."}],["$","p","Students are more anxious. And the old idea of “go wherever everyone else is going” is no longer enough.",{"children":"Students are more anxious. And the old idea of “go wherever everyone else is going” is no longer enough."}],["$","p","The smarter question today is not:",{"children":"The smarter question today is not:"}],["$","p","Which country is most popular?",{"children":"Which country is most popular?"}],["$","p","It is:",{"children":"It is:"}],["$","p","Which country gives me the best mix of education quality, affordability, work exposure, safety, economic opportunity, and long-term career value?",{"children":"Which country gives me the best mix of education quality, affordability, work exposure, safety, economic opportunity, and long-term career value?"}],["$","p","That is where Luxembourg enters the conversation.",{"children":"That is where Luxembourg enters the conversation."}],["$","p","Not as a flashy replacement for Canada, the UK, or Australia. Not as a destination every student should blindly choose. But as one of the most underrated European options Indian students should seriously understand before finalising their study abroad plan.",{"children":"Not as a flashy replacement for Canada, the UK, or Australia. Not as a destination every student should blindly choose. But as one of the most underrated European options Indian students should seriously understand before finalising their study abroad plan."}]],"$L5"]}],"$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d"]}],"$L1e"]}]}],"$L1f"]}],["$L20"],"$L21"]}],"isPartial":"$@22","staleTime":"$23","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L24","isPartial":"$@25","staleTime":"$23","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L26","isPartial":"$@27","staleTime":"$23","varyParams":"$28"},{"rsc":"$L29","isPartial":"$@2a","staleTime":"$23","varyParams":"$28"},{"rsc":"$L2b","isPartial":"$@2c","staleTime":"$23","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@2d","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@2e"}
