2f:["$","p","The cost of living is another point Indian families should understand honestly. Luxembourg is often seen as expensive, and that is true in many ways. Accommodation, food, lifestyle, and",{"children":"The cost of living is another point Indian families should understand honestly. Luxembourg is often seen as expensive, and that is true in many ways. Accommodation, food, lifestyle, and"}]
30:["$","p","daily expenses can be higher than in many other European countries.",{"children":"daily expenses can be higher than in many other European countries."}]
31:["$","p","But the cost conversation should not stop there.",{"children":"But the cost conversation should not stop there."}]
32:["$","p","Luxembourg also has significantly higher average salaries compared to many countries, which is one reason it continues to attract global professionals. This does not mean every student will",{"children":"Luxembourg also has significantly higher average salaries compared to many countries, which is one reason it continues to attract global professionals. This does not mean every student will"}]
33:["$","p","automatically earn well after graduation, but it does show that Luxembourg’s economy operates at a higher-value level.",{"children":"automatically earn well after graduation, but it does show that Luxembourg’s economy operates at a higher-value level."}]
34:["$","p","So the real question is not simply:",{"children":"So the real question is not simply:"}]
35:["$","p","“Is Luxembourg expensive?”",{"children":"“Is Luxembourg expensive?”"}]
36:["$","p","The better question is:",{"children":"The better question is:"}]
37:["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]
38:["$","p","Sometimes that may be Canada.",{"children":"Sometimes that may be Canada."}]
39:["$","p","Sometimes the UK.",{"children":"Sometimes the UK."}]
3a:["$","p","Sometimes Australia.",{"children":"Sometimes Australia."}]
3b:["$","p","Sometimes the US.",{"children":"Sometimes the US."}]
3c:["$","p","Sometimes Germany, Ireland, France, or the Netherlands.",{"children":"Sometimes Germany, Ireland, France, or the Netherlands."}]
3d:["$","p","And sometimes, for the right student, it may be Luxembourg.",{"children":"And sometimes, for the right student, it may be Luxembourg."}]
3e:["$","p","The real mistake is not choosing one country over another. The real mistake is choosing without asking the right questions.",{"children":"The real mistake is not choosing one country over another. The real mistake is choosing without asking the right questions."}]
3f:["$","p","Before finalising any destination, Indian students and parents should ask:",{"children":"Before finalising any destination, Indian students and parents should ask:"}]
